property:
本项检查：assert!(hashes_x.len() >= 3 && hashes_y.len() >= 3)；assert!( !ax.workers.contains(&key_y), "router_a cross-attributed worker_y to prefix X: {:?}", ax.workers, )；assert!( !ay.workers.contains(&key_x), "router_a cross-attributed worker_x to prefix Y: {:?}", ay.workers, )；assert!( !bx.workers.contains(&key_y), "router_b cross-attributed worker_y to prefix X: {:?}", bx.workers, )；assert!( !by.workers.contains(&key_x), "router_b cross-attributed worker_x to prefix Y: {:?}", by.workers, )；panic!( "trees did not converge within 3s:
 \ router_a: X={{matched={}, workers={:?}}}, Y={{matched={}, workers={:?}}}
 \ router_b: X={{matched={}, workers={:?}}}, Y={{matched={}, workers={:?}}}
 \ targets: X={target_x}, Y={target_y}", ax.matched_blocks, ax.workers, ay.matched_blocks, ay.workers, bx.matched_blocks, bx.workers, by.matched_blocks, by.workers, )；assert!(r.is_ok(), "router_a shutdown hung")；assert!(r.is_ok(), "router_b shutdown hung")

